text.en:
Inside the clocked branch map each state to the next one, and drive `state <= std_logic_vector(s);` concurrently outside the process.
```vhdl
if s = "00" then s <= "01";
elsif s = "01" then s <= "10";
else s <= "00";
end if;
```

text.es:
Dentro de la rama del reloj mapea cada estado al siguiente y asigna `state <= std_logic_vector(s);` de forma concurrente fuera del proceso.
```vhdl
if s = "00" then s <= "01";
elsif s = "01" then s <= "10";
else s <= "00";
end if;
```
